"entity": {
"name": "KBC Group N.V.",
"description": "KBC Group NV engages in the provision of bank insurance services. It operates through the following segments: Belgium Division, Czech Republic Division, International Markets Business Division, and Group Center. The Belgium Division segment focuses on the activities in Belgium. The Czech Republic Division segment includes all its activities in the Czech Republic. The International Markets Business Division segment involves in the activities conducted in Ireland, Hungary, Slovakia, and Bulgaria. The Group Center segment relates to the results of the holding company and includes elements not attributed to other divisions. The company was founded on February 9, 1935 and is headquartered in Brussels, Belgium.",
